{"messageCode":200,"response":"OK","Nota":{"codNota":5803356,"titulo":"Aviso REF:581143","codSeccion":"UNICA","fecha":"10-11-2026","codDiario":330726,"cadenaContenido":"\u003c!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.01//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/html4/strict.dtd\"\u003e \u003cHTML\u003e \u003chead\u003e   \u003ctitle\u003eEstados Unidos Mexicanos\u003c/title\u003e                            \u003cstyle type\u003d\u0027text/css\u0027\u003e .Normal {text-indent:0.0pt;font-size:9.0pt;margin-left:0.0pt;font-family:Tahoma,Arial Unicode MS,Verdana,system, , ,Arial Black,sans-serif,Helvetica,dialog;} \u003c/style\u003e \u003c/head\u003e \u003cBODY\u003e \u003cdiv style\u003d \u0027\u0027 \u003e \u003cdiv style\u003d\u0027margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0.0pt;\u0027 class\u003d\u0027Normal\u0027\u003e \u003cspan style\u003d\u0027font-family:Times;font-weight:bold;\u0027\u003eEstados Unidos Mexicanos\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv style\u003d\u0027margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0.0pt;\u0027 class\u003d\u0027Normal\u0027\u003e \u003cspan style\u003d\u0027font-family:Times;font-weight:bold;\u0027\u003ePoder Judicial Federal\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv style\u003d\u0027margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0.0pt;\u0027 class\u003d\u0027Normal\u0027\u003e \u003cspan style\u003d\u0027font-family:Times;font-weight:bold;\u0027\u003eTercer Tribunal Colegiado en Materia Civil del Tercer Circuito\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv style\u003d\u0027margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0.0pt;\u0027 class\u003d\u0027Normal\u0027\u003e \u003cspan style\u003d\u0027font-family:Times;font-weight:bold;\u0027\u003eZapopan, Jalisco\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv style\u003d\u0027margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0.0pt;\u0027 class\u003d\u0027Normal\u0027\u003e \u003cspan style\u003d\u0027font-family:Arial;\u0027\u003eEDICTOS A LOS:\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv style\u003d\u0027margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0.0pt;\u0027 class\u003d\u0027Normal\u0027\u003e \u003cspan style\u003d\u0027font-family:Arial;\u0027\u003eTERCEROS INTERESADOS\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv style\u003d\u0027margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:14.4pt;\u0027 class\u003d\u0027Normal\u0027\u003e \u0026nbsp;\u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv style\u003d\u0027margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0.0pt;\u0027 class\u003d\u0027Normal\u0027\u003e \u003cspan style\u003d\u0027font-family:Arial;\u0027\u003eMaría Enriqueta Ernestina Peña Magaña y Grupo Agrícola Alvarso\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv style\u003d\u0027margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0.0pt;\u0027 class\u003d\u0027Normal\u0027\u003e \u003cspan style\u003d\u0027font-family:Arial;\u0027\u003esociedad de producción rural de responsabilidad limitada\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv style\u003d\u0027margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:14.4pt;\u0027 class\u003d\u0027Normal\u0027\u003e \u003cspan style\u003d\u0027font-family:Arial;\u0027\u003eEn el \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\u0027font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;\u0027\u003eamparo directo 697/2025 \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\u0027font-family:Arial;\u0027\u003epromovido por Banco Multiva, Sociedad Anónima Institución de Banca\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\u0027font-family:Arial;\u0027\u003e \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\u0027font-family:Arial;\u0027\u003eMúltiple, Grupo Financiero Multiva, contra acto de la \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\u0027font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;\u0027\u003ePrimer Tribunal Colegiado de Apelación del Tercer\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\u0027font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;\u0027\u003e \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\u0027font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;\u0027\u003eCircuito\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\u0027font-family:Arial;\u0027\u003e,\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\u0027font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;\u0027\u003e \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\u0027font-family:Arial;\u0027\u003econsistente en la sentencia de \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\u0027font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;\u0027\u003eveintitrés de julio de dos mil veinticinco\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\u0027font-family:Arial;\u0027\u003e,\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\u0027font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;\u0027\u003e \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\u0027font-family:Arial;\u0027\u003edictada en el \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\u0027font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;\u0027\u003etoca civil\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\u0027font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;\u0027\u003e \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\u0027font-family:Arial;\u0027\u003e22/2025; se ordenó emplazarla por edictos para que comparezca dentro de los treinta días siguientes de la\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\u0027font-family:Arial;\u0027\u003e \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\u0027font-family:Arial;\u0027\u003eúltima publicación, si a su interés legal conviene; en el entendido de que en la secretaría de acuerdos quedan\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\u0027font-family:Arial;\u0027\u003e \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\u0027font-family:Arial;\u0027\u003ea su disposición las copias de la demanda.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv style\u003d\u0027margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0.0pt;\u0027 class\u003d\u0027Normal\u0027\u003e \u003cspan style\u003d\u0027font-family:Arial;\u0027\u003ePara su publicación por tres veces, de siete en siete días,\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv style\u003d\u0027margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0.0pt;\u0027 class\u003d\u0027Normal\u0027\u003e \u003cspan style\u003d\u0027font-family:Arial;\u0027\u003een el Diario Oficial de la Federación y el periódico Excélsior.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv style\u003d\u0027margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:14.4pt;\u0027 class\u003d\u0027Normal\u0027\u003e \u0026nbsp;\u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv style\u003d\u0027margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0.0pt;\u0027 class\u003d\u0027Normal\u0027\u003e \u003cspan style\u003d\u0027font-family:Arial;\u0027\u003eZapopan, Jalisco, a veintitrés de septiembre de dos mil veintiséis.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv style\u003d\u0027margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0.0pt;\u0027 class\u003d\u0027Normal\u0027\u003e \u003cspan style\u003d\u0027font-family:Arial;\u0027\u003eEl Secretario de Tribunal\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv style\u003d\u0027margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0.0pt;\u0027 class\u003d\u0027Normal\u0027\u003e \u003cspan style\u003d\u0027font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;\u0027\u003eJosé Neguib Beltrán Fernández\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv style\u003d\u0027margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0.0pt;\u0027 class\u003d\u0027Normal\u0027\u003e \u003cspan style\u003d\u0027font-family:Arial;\u0027\u003eR\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\u0027font-family:Arial;\u0027\u003eú\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style\u003d\u0027font-family:Arial;\u0027\u003ebrica.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv style\u003d\u0027margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:right;text-indent:0.0pt;\u0027 class\u003d\u0027Normal\u0027\u003e \u003cspan style\u003d\u0027text-transform:uppercase;font-family:Arial;font-weight:bold;\u0027\u003e(R.- 581143)\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e \u003c/div\u003e \u003cdiv style\u003d\u0027margin-left:0.0pt;text-align:right;text-indent:0.0pt;\u0027 class\u003d\u0027Normal\u0027\u003e \u0026nbsp;\u003c/div\u003e \u003c/div\u003e  \u003c/BODY\u003e \u003c/HT